1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:04,670
I'm Eddie Zhang, and this is WenQuest Ops.
我是 Eddie Zhang，这是 WenQuest Ops。

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:11,614
It runs a small company's orders, stock, purchasing, money and quality from one connected record.
它用一份连通的记录，管好一家小公司的订单、库存、采购、资金和质量。

3
00:00:11,754 --> 00:00:15,114
AI drafts the paperwork. People decide.
AI 起草文书，人来决定。

4
00:00:15,254 --> 00:00:21,072
Everything you'll see is a working replica, with a fictional company called Harbor Lane Supply.
下面看到的都是可以操作的复制品，用的是一家虚构的公司：Harbor Lane Supply。

5
00:00:21,592 --> 00:00:27,872
Picture a Tuesday. A customer asks why order ten forty-two is late.
设想一个周二。客户问：一零四二号订单为什么迟了？

6
00:00:28,262 --> 00:00:33,682
The facts exist. The order is in the ERP. The shortage is in a spreadsheet.
事实都在。订单在 ERP 里，缺料在表格里。

7
00:00:34,072 --> 00:00:40,352
The supplier's delay sits in someone's inbox. The failed inspection is on paper.
供应商延期在某个人的邮箱里，检验不合格记在纸上。

8
00:00:40,492 --> 00:00:43,828
Nobody can see the chain, so the morning goes to phone calls.
没人看得见这条链，一上午都花在打电话上。

9
00:00:44,218 --> 00:00:49,698
By the time you have the answer, the customer has already called your competitor.
等您弄清楚，客户已经打电话给您的竞争对手了。

10
00:00:50,218 --> 00:00:53,864
Each record lives in its own tool, owned by one person.
每份记录都在各自的工具里，归一个人管。

11
00:00:54,254 --> 00:00:58,778
We connect what you already have. Nobody types anything twice.
我们把您已有的连起来。谁也不用重复录入。

12
00:00:59,548 --> 00:01:05,958
Audit week is the second pain. Evidence is hunted down at the last minute, and records can be quietly edited.
第二件头疼事是审核周：证据临时到处找，记录还可能被悄悄改掉。

13
00:01:06,348 --> 00:01:12,857
The third is the new AI tools. They are fast, but nobody can check where an answer came from.
第三件是新的 AI 工具：快是快，可谁也查不了答案从哪来。

14
00:01:13,247 --> 00:01:19,027
And when a key person leaves, what they knew leaves with them.
关键的人一走，他知道的东西也跟着走了。

15
00:01:19,547 --> 00:01:27,698
Here is the design. At the bottom is ERPNext, a mature open-source ERP, used exactly as it is.
设计就这样。最底下是 ERPNext，成熟的开源 ERP，原样使用。

16
00:01:28,088 --> 00:01:33,657
Above it is our operations hub. It reads every change, connects the records, and checks them.
上面是我们的运营中枢：读取每一次变动，把记录连起来，并检查它们。

17
00:01:34,047 --> 00:01:39,432
On top are the quality system and an AI assistant. Every screen reads the same record.
再上面是质量体系和 AI 助手。每个画面读的都是同一份记录。

18
00:01:40,202 --> 00:01:45,382
One rule runs through everything. AI drafts, and people sign.
一条规则贯穿始终：AI 起草，人签字。

19
00:01:45,772 --> 00:01:53,456
Ask the AI for a nonconformance report. It writes from the inspection record, and cites it.
让 AI 起草不合格报告：它照检验记录写，并注明出处。

20
00:01:53,846 --> 00:01:59,602
Ask it to sign, and it is refused. A signature needs a named person and their own password.
让它签字？拒绝。签字必须是具名的人，用自己的密码。

21
00:02:00,371 --> 00:02:06,667
Four rules hold in every module. Code judges pass or fail. People sign, and someone else approves.
每个模块都守四条规则：合格与否由程序判定；人签字，由另一个人批准。

22
00:02:07,057 --> 00:02:12,433
History only grows. The database itself refuses edits to signed records.
记录只增不改，签过字的记录，数据库本身就拒绝修改。

23
00:02:12,573 --> 00:02:18,913
And unknown is never pass. A supplier we never inspected shows unknown, not a perfect score.
还有，未知不等于合格。从没检验过的供应商显示“未知”，不是满分。

24
00:02:19,303 --> 00:02:24,800
These rules are enforced in the software, so they hold even on a busy day.
这些规则由软件强制执行，再忙的时候也守得住。

25
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:29,883
First, the base. An ERP is your single book of record.
先说底座。ERP 是公司唯一的账本。

26
00:02:30,273 --> 00:02:36,897
One list of items, customers and suppliers. Every transaction is posted once.
一份物料、客户、供应商清单，每笔业务只记一次。

27
00:02:37,037 --> 00:02:43,157
Submit one delivery note, and the stock ledger, the general ledger and the customer all move together.
提交一张发货单：库存台账、总账、客户记录一起动。

28
00:02:43,547 --> 00:02:46,967
Sales, the warehouse and accounting stop keeping their own copies.
销售、仓库和会计，再也不用各留一份。

29
00:02:47,487 --> 00:02:54,768
Why ERPNext? It's open source, built on the Frappe framework, and free to run on your own server.
为什么选 ERPNext？它开源，基于 Frappe 框架，在自己的服务器上免费运行。

30
00:02:55,158 --> 00:03:01,058
There are no per-user licences. Every document has an open interface, and that's how we talk to it.
不按人头收许可费。每种单据都有开放接口，我们就是通过接口和它打交道。

31
00:03:01,198 --> 00:03:07,578
We use the official version, never a modified copy. When it improves, you get the improvements.
我们用官方版本，从不改它的源码。它升级，您就跟着受益。

32
00:03:08,098 --> 00:03:17,598
ERPNext covers the whole back office: accounting, stock, buying, selling, manufacturing, projects, assets and more.
ERPNext 覆盖整个后台：会计、库存、采购、销售、生产、项目、资产等等。

33
00:03:17,988 --> 00:03:23,468
For stock, it keeps the ledger. We read it to find stock-outs and days on hand.
库存方面，它记台账；我们读台账，算出缺货和库存天数。

34
00:03:23,858 --> 00:03:28,204
For quality, it has basic inspections. We add the full quality system on top.
质量方面，它只有基本检验；我们在上面加了完整的质量体系。

35
00:03:28,974 --> 00:03:30,914
Order to cash takes five documents.
从订单到收款，一共五张单据。

36
00:03:31,304 --> 00:03:37,184
A quotation and a sales order change neither stock nor the books.
报价单和销售订单，既不动库存，也不动账。

37
00:03:37,574 --> 00:03:41,414
The delivery note takes goods out of stock and posts their cost.
发货单把货从库存里发出，同时记下成本。

38
00:03:41,804 --> 00:03:46,184
The sales invoice creates what the customer owes, and the payment clears it.
销售发票记下客户欠款，收款再把它冲掉。

39
00:03:46,954 --> 00:03:48,947
Procure to pay is the mirror image.
从采购到付款，正好是镜像。

40
00:03:49,337 --> 00:03:54,977
The purchase order carries a promised date. That's how we measure whether a supplier is on time.
采购订单写着承诺日期，我们就用它衡量供应商准不准时。

41
00:03:55,367 --> 00:04:01,061
The purchase receipt brings goods into stock, and our incoming inspection starts right there.
采购收货把货收进库存，我们的来料检验就从这里开始。

42
00:04:01,451 --> 00:04:05,891
The supplier's invoice moves the amount to payables, and the payment clears it.
供应商发票把金额转为应付，付款再把它冲掉。

43
00:04:06,661 --> 00:04:12,805
Here it is live. Every document posts balanced entries.
现场演示：每张单据都记一笔平衡的账。

44
00:04:13,195 --> 00:04:17,175
Receive the bolts, take the invoice, pay the supplier, ship to the customer.
收下螺栓，收到发票，付供应商，发货给客户。

45
00:04:17,565 --> 00:04:22,226
Invoice the customer and get paid. Debits equal credits after every step.
给客户开票、收款。每一步之后，借贷都相等。

46
00:04:22,616 --> 00:04:26,656
This is double-entry bookkeeping, done by the documents your people already use.
这就是复式记账，由员工本来就在用的单据自动完成。

47
00:04:27,176 --> 00:04:31,834
The statements come straight from those entries: profit and loss, and the balance sheet.
报表直接从这些分录算出来：利润表和资产负债表。

48
00:04:32,224 --> 00:04:39,524
Month-end is bank reconciliation, ageing reports and a closing voucher, all inside ERPNext.
月结是银行对账、账龄报告和结账凭证，全在 ERPNext 里完成。

49
00:04:39,664 --> 00:04:45,384
When you need them, there are cost centres, budgets, multiple currencies and taxes.
需要的话，还有成本中心、预算、多币种和税务。

50
00:04:45,904 --> 00:04:50,944
Stock is a ledger too. Every movement has a quantity, a rate and a running value.
库存也是一本账。每次进出都有数量、单价和结存金额。

51
00:04:51,334 --> 00:04:53,714
Two receipts at different prices come in.
两批货按不同价格收进来。

52
00:04:54,104 --> 00:05:00,344
Then a shipment goes out, costed by the method your accountant chose.
然后发出一批，按会计选定的方法计算成本。

53
00:05:01,114 --> 00:05:06,406
First in, first out, or moving average. Change a price and compare.
先进先出，还是移动平均？改一个价格比一比。

54
00:05:06,796 --> 00:05:14,155
When prices rise, the two methods value the same shipment differently. We simply read what the ledger computed.
价格上涨时，两种方法算出的发货成本不同。我们只读台账算好的数。

55
00:05:14,925 --> 00:05:23,738
In practice, stock is kept by warehouse, and goods on quality hold stay apart from what you can sell.
实际用起来，库存按仓库分开，质量冻结的货和能卖的货分开放。

56
00:05:24,128 --> 00:05:29,328
Below the reorder level, one click drafts a purchase order. It waits for a person.
低于补货点，点一下就起草采购单。它等人来确认。

57
00:05:29,718 --> 00:05:34,728
Batch and serial numbers are how a recall finds every customer who received a lot.
批号和序列号，是召回时找到每一位收到这批货的客户的依据。

58
00:05:35,248 --> 00:05:45,283
ERPNext also runs manufacturing with bills of materials and work orders, projects, assets and a simple customer pipeline.
ERPNext 还管生产（物料清单和工单）、项目、资产，以及简单的客户管理。

59
00:05:45,673 --> 00:05:48,453
We don't replace any of it. We connect to it.
这些我们都不替换，只是连起来用。

60
00:05:48,973 --> 00:05:55,925
Now the heart of the product, the operations hub. It is built, and it runs today on top of ERPNext.
现在讲产品的核心：运营中枢。它已经做好，今天就架在 ERPNext 上运行。

61
00:05:56,315 --> 00:06:03,455
Every change becomes an event, numbered and kept, so nothing is lost if a sync is interrupted.
每一次变动都记成一个事件，编号保存，同步中断也不丢。

62
00:06:03,845 --> 00:06:06,557
Events become measures, with formulas anyone can check.
事件算成指标，公式人人可查。

63
00:06:06,947 --> 00:06:11,091
And measures that go wrong become anomalies, together with their causes.
指标出了问题，就变成异常，并附上原因。

64
00:06:11,861 --> 00:06:19,921
Every five minutes the hub asks ERPNext only for what changed. It never writes back on its own.
中枢每五分钟只向 ERPNext 要变动过的记录。它自己从不写回。

65
00:06:20,311 --> 00:06:25,051
Watch. A buyer moves a purchase order's promised date by a week.
看：采购员把一张采购单的承诺日期推迟了一周。

66
00:06:25,441 --> 00:06:32,421
The change arrives, and two sales orders that depend on it are flagged at risk. Nobody had to look.
变动一到，依赖它的两张销售订单就被标为“有风险”。没人需要去盯。

67
00:06:32,561 --> 00:06:38,621
Because every change is kept, the whole picture can be rebuilt from scratch with the same result.
因为每次变动都保存下来，整张图随时可以从头重建，结果完全一样。

68
00:06:39,141 --> 00:06:44,061
Inside, the hub keeps one connected picture of the business, across eight areas.
中枢内部，把整个业务连成一张图，分八个领域。

69
00:06:44,451 --> 00:06:49,411
Click an item, and you see its orders, its stock and its inspections.
点一个物料，就看到它的订单、库存和检验。

70
00:06:49,801 --> 00:06:54,141
Click a purchase order, and you see its supplier and its receipt.
点一张采购单，就看到它的供应商和收货。

71
00:06:54,531 --> 00:07:01,851
Customers, sales, items, suppliers, warehouses, quality, people and money, all linked.
客户、销售、物料、供应商、仓库、质量、人员和资金，全部连在一起。

72
00:07:02,371 --> 00:07:06,591
This is the wall display, for the shop floor or the office screen.
这是车间或办公室大屏上的看板。

73
00:07:06,981 --> 00:07:14,281
On-time delivery, stock-outs and inspections move as the records change. No one updates it by hand.
准时交付、缺货、检验，随记录实时变化，没人手工更新。

74
00:07:14,421 --> 00:07:18,217
Put it on a television in the warehouse, and everyone sees the same day.
把它放到仓库的电视上，大家看到的就是同一天的实情。

75
00:07:18,737 --> 00:07:23,257
And this is the morning dashboard, the first screen you open each day.
这是每天早上第一眼看的看板。

76
00:07:23,647 --> 00:07:29,927
On-time delivery and late orders. Stock-outs. Inventory value and days on hand.
准时交付率和迟到订单。缺货。库存金额和库存天数。

77
00:07:30,067 --> 00:07:36,067
Supplier on-time rate, and open nonconformances, with what needs attention listed below.
供应商准时率、未关闭的不合格品，下面列出今天要处理的事。

78
00:07:36,207 --> 00:07:41,907
Every tile opens to the records behind it. Let's open the late orders.
每一格都能点开背后的记录。我们点开迟到订单。

79
00:07:42,677 --> 00:07:47,197
Every number on that dashboard has a published formula you can check by hand.
看板上每个数都有公开的公式，可以自己手算核对。

80
00:07:47,587 --> 00:07:51,757
Change which orders count, and on-time delivery changes with them.
改一下计入哪些订单，准时交付率跟着变。

81
00:07:52,147 --> 00:07:57,327
With no shipments, days on hand says unknown. Never zero, and never a guess.
没有发货时，库存天数显示“未知”。不写零，也不猜。

82
00:07:58,097 --> 00:08:00,617
Now, back to Tuesday.
现在，回到那个周二。

83
00:08:01,007 --> 00:08:04,327
Click the late order, and the hub follows the links for you.
点开迟到的订单，中枢替您顺着链接往下找。

84
00:08:04,717 --> 00:08:09,237
The item is four hundred short, because its purchase order arrived six days late.
物料缺四百件，因为它的采购单晚到了六天。

85
00:08:09,627 --> 00:08:11,867
A morning of phone calls becomes one minute.
一上午的电话，变成一分钟。

86
00:08:12,007 --> 00:08:16,407
The same chain works for a supplier, an item, or a failed inspection.
同样的追查，也适用于供应商、物料或不合格的检验。

87
00:08:16,927 --> 00:08:20,988
Fixes come back as drafts, from the assistant or from a rule.
解决办法以草稿形式回来，来自助手，或者来自规则。

88
00:08:21,378 --> 00:08:26,278
A purchase order, an inspection result, or a note to the customer.
一张采购单、一个检验结果，或者一封给客户的说明。

89
00:08:26,668 --> 00:08:33,008
Nothing reaches ERPNext until a person clicks confirm, and the confirmation is logged.
人不点“确认”，什么也进不了 ERPNext；每次确认都留记录。

90
00:08:33,398 --> 00:08:38,138
If a person discards a draft, they write down why, and that is kept too.
如果有人放弃一份草稿，要写下原因，这也会留下来。

91
00:08:38,658 --> 00:08:40,483
The assistant sits on every page.
助手在每一页都在。

92
00:08:40,873 --> 00:08:46,513
Ask which orders are late, and why. It answers from your records and cites every one.
问它哪些订单迟了、为什么。它照您的记录回答，每条都注明出处。

93
00:08:46,903 --> 00:08:51,643
It reads with your permissions, and every run is logged.
它按您的权限读取，每次运行都留记录。

94
00:08:51,783 --> 00:08:56,983
It can draft a reorder or a delay note, but it can never sign or send on its own.
它可以起草补货单或延误说明，但永远不能自己签字或发送。

95
00:08:57,503 --> 00:09:06,543
Next, the operations boards. Sales and delivery shows orders by week, top customers, and what is late or at risk.
接下来是运营看板。销售与交付：每周订单、主要客户，还有迟到或有风险的订单。

96
00:09:06,933 --> 00:09:13,625
At risk means due within a week with a shortage. The hub flags it before it becomes late.
“有风险”是一周内到期又缺料。中枢在它迟到之前就标出来。

97
00:09:14,395 --> 00:09:20,295
Purchasing shows open orders, what is overdue, and each supplier's on-time rate, line by line.
采购看板：未完成的采购单、逾期的，以及每家供应商逐行计算的准时率。

98
00:09:20,685 --> 00:09:23,785
The receiving queue shows lots waiting for incoming inspection.
收货队列列出等待来料检验的批次。

99
00:09:24,175 --> 00:09:28,541
A supplier with no receipts yet shows unknown, never a perfect score.
还没有收过货的供应商显示“未知”，绝不是满分。

100
00:09:29,061 --> 00:09:31,501
For you, the owner, the finance board.
给老板的，是财务看板。

101
00:09:31,891 --> 00:09:37,116
What you invoiced this week, who owes you, what is overdue, and what you owe next.
这周开了多少票，谁欠您钱，哪些逾期，接下来要付多少。

102
00:09:37,256 --> 00:09:43,322
It reads ERPNext's own invoices, so it matches your accountant to the cent.
它读的就是 ERPNext 里的发票，所以和会计一分不差。

103
00:09:43,462 --> 00:09:48,761
Turn on visitor mode, and the amounts are hidden when someone is looking over your shoulder.
打开访客模式，有人在旁边看时，金额就隐藏起来。

104
00:09:49,281 --> 00:09:58,757
Next on our plan, and clearly marked as planned, is warehousing: bins, pick lists, packing labels and cycle counts.
下一步计划、页面上明确标着“计划中”的，是仓储：库位、拣货单、包装标签和循环盘点。

105
00:09:59,147 --> 00:10:02,620
Everything else you see in this video is working software.
这段视频里其他的一切，都是已经能用的软件。

106
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:12,457
Then quality, where most small companies drown. A standard like ISO 9001 or 13485 becomes running processes.
然后是质量，多数小公司最吃力的地方。ISO 9001、13485 这样的标准，变成运行中的流程。

107
00:10:12,847 --> 00:10:18,447
Each control is tied to a clause, and checks read your actual records every day.
每项控制对应一个条款，每天读取实际记录来检查。

108
00:10:18,587 --> 00:10:24,967
The written procedure is generated from the configured workflow, so the two never drift apart.
书面程序文件由配置好的流程生成，两者永远一致。

109
00:10:25,487 --> 00:10:30,927
This is the health view. Green means today's records satisfy the control.
这是体系健康视图。绿色：今天的记录满足要求。

110
00:10:31,317 --> 00:10:37,144
Red names the exact record that doesn't, like a torque wrench past its calibration date.
红色直接指出哪一条不满足，比如一把过了校准期的扭力扳手。

111
00:10:37,534 --> 00:10:40,707
Before an audit, you already know what the auditor will find.
审核之前，您就已经知道审核员会发现什么。

112
00:10:41,227 --> 00:10:44,779
Every nonconformance moves through fixed steps.
每一件不合格品都按固定的步骤走。

113
00:10:45,169 --> 00:10:46,549
First, contain it and sign.
先隔离，签字。

114
00:10:46,939 --> 00:10:51,519
Then propose a disposition, such as return to supplier.
再提出处置意见，比如退回供应商。

115
00:10:51,909 --> 00:10:56,616
Now try to approve your own proposal. It is refused. Someone else must approve.
想自己批自己的意见？拒绝。必须由另一个人批。

116
00:10:57,006 --> 00:11:02,086
Every step is signed and kept. Nothing is overwritten, so the history tells the true story.
每一步都签字保存，什么都不覆盖，记录讲的就是真实经过。

117
00:11:02,226 --> 00:11:07,146
When the cause is found, the corrective action is tracked to verification and closure.
找到原因后，纠正措施一直跟踪到验证和关闭。

118
00:11:07,666 --> 00:11:13,046
This is an incoming inspection, sampled by plan, with limits from the plan.
这是一次来料检验，按计划抽样，限值来自检验计划。

119
00:11:13,436 --> 00:11:21,418
Type a reading out of tolerance, and it turns red at once. The verdict comes from code, not from the AI.
输入一个超差读数，立刻变红。判定由程序给出，不由 AI 决定。

120
00:11:21,808 --> 00:11:27,508
When the lot is signed, the verdict is final, and a failing lot opens a nonconformance with one click.
批次签字后判定即为最终结果；不合格的批次，一键开出不合格报告。

121
00:11:28,028 --> 00:11:31,474
Signed inspections feed the control charts.
签过字的检验数据进入控制图。

122
00:11:31,864 --> 00:11:36,364
When the process shifts, a point turns red before bad parts pile up.
工序一偏，点就变红，赶在废品堆起来之前。

123
00:11:36,754 --> 00:11:40,454
One click opens a nonconformance report from that signal.
点一下，就从这个信号开出不合格报告。

124
00:11:40,844 --> 00:11:45,744
If the specification limits are missing, capability shows unknown instead of a made-up number.
缺少规格限值时，过程能力显示“未知”，不编一个数。

125
00:11:46,264 --> 00:11:54,304
Bring your shared drive as it is. For each file, the AI suggests the type, number and revision.
共享盘原样上传。每个文件，AI 给出类型、编号和版本建议。

126
00:11:54,694 --> 00:12:02,534
It quotes the text it read, so a person can check before confirming. Then the file is under document control.
它引用读到的原文，人核对后再确认。确认后文件就进入文件控制。

127
00:12:02,924 --> 00:12:08,504
Documents then have versions, reviews, and reading sign-off for the people who must know them.
此后文件有版本、有评审，该知道的人要签字确认已读。

128
00:12:09,024 --> 00:12:14,502
Next, regulated products. A production record is signed step by step, in order.
接下来是受监管产品。生产记录逐步签字，按顺序进行。

129
00:12:14,892 --> 00:12:19,752
A gauge past its calibration date is refused. The lot is released by someone who did not build it.
过了校准期的量具不能用。批次由没有参与生产的人放行。

130
00:12:20,142 --> 00:12:24,202
When every step is signed, the record is complete and ready for an auditor.
每一步都签完，记录就完整了，随时可以给审核员看。

131
00:12:24,722 --> 00:12:27,102
For medical devices, scan the label.
医疗器械，扫一下标签。

132
00:12:27,492 --> 00:12:32,232
The device identifier, the lot and the expiry date are read and checked.
器械标识、批号和有效期读出来并校验。

133
00:12:32,622 --> 00:12:35,602
Then the lot is traced to every shipment.
再把这一批追到每一次发货。

134
00:12:35,992 --> 00:12:41,531
The identifier comes from the issuing agency. We check it, and we never invent one.
器械标识来自发码机构。我们只校验，从不自己编。

135
00:12:42,051 --> 00:12:45,011
A supplier warns that a lot of boxes may be bad.
供应商提醒：有一批纸箱可能有问题。

136
00:12:45,401 --> 00:12:50,641
Trace it forward, to the lots that used it, the deliveries, and the customers.
往下追：用了它的生产批、发出的货、收货的客户。

137
00:12:51,031 --> 00:12:54,977
Start a mock recall from the same screen, and record who confirmed it.
在同一个画面发起模拟召回，记下谁确认的。

138
00:12:55,747 --> 00:12:59,127
Then the digital factory, starting with moving in.
然后是数字工厂，先从搬家说起。

139
00:12:59,517 --> 00:13:06,617
Bring the old system's export. Columns are matched, and every row is previewed before anyone signs.
把老系统导出的表拿来：自动对上列，签字之前每一行都能预览。

140
00:13:07,007 --> 00:13:12,767
Open orders arrive as drafts, and importing the same file twice changes nothing.
未完成的订单以草稿导入；同一个文件导两次，什么也不会变。

141
00:13:13,287 --> 00:13:19,198
Measuring machines send their files straight in. Each reading lands on the right part and feature.
测量设备的文件直接导入。每个读数落到对应的零件和项目上。

142
00:13:19,588 --> 00:13:23,928
Readings outside the plan's limits are marked, and a person signs the import.
超出计划限值的读数会标出来，由人签字导入。

143
00:13:24,448 --> 00:13:28,848
Machines connect too, each with its own key.
设备也能接进来，每台有自己的钥匙。

144
00:13:29,238 --> 00:13:33,518
A reading from a machine lands in an inbox, and it waits.
设备发来的读数先进收件箱，等着。

145
00:13:33,908 --> 00:13:38,748
A person accepts it, and it joins the inspection. A machine never signs.
人接收后，它才进入检验记录。设备永远不签字。

146
00:13:39,138 --> 00:13:42,903
Revoke a machine's key, and its next reading is refused and logged.
吊销一台设备的钥匙，它下一次发来的读数就会被拒收并留记录。

147
00:13:43,423 --> 00:13:51,643
For your engineers: ERPNext runs in its official image, and the hub is Python with a Postgres database.
给工程师：ERPNext 用官方镜像运行，中枢用 Python 和 Postgres 数据库。

148
00:13:52,033 --> 00:13:58,252
Installation is one script, with automatic secure web access, backup and restore.
安装只要一个脚本，自动配好安全访问、备份和恢复。

149
00:13:58,392 --> 00:14:06,244
The modules that judge pass or fail are checked on every change, so they never import AI or network code.
判定合格与否的模块，每次改动都会检查，保证不引入 AI 或联网代码。

150
00:14:06,384 --> 00:14:10,784
Sign-in can use your own accounts, Microsoft or Google.
登录可以用自己的账号，也可以用 Microsoft 或 Google 账号。

151
00:14:10,924 --> 00:14:16,524
Other systems can read events in order, and send data that waits for a person to accept.
其他系统可以按顺序读取事件，发来的数据要等人接收。

152
00:14:17,044 --> 00:14:18,422
And this is where it leads.
这就是它通向的地方。

153
00:14:18,812 --> 00:14:25,092
A factory where the warehouse, the robots, vision inspection and every gauge feed one hub.
一座工厂：仓库、机器人、视觉质检、每一件量具，都汇入同一个中枢。

154
00:14:25,613 --> 00:14:31,493
At the inspection station, vision reads each part's code and measures it against the drawing.
质检站上，视觉系统读每个零件的码，按图纸测量。

155
00:14:31,883 --> 00:14:37,983
Bad parts are set aside automatically, and the trend is charted before scrap piles up.
不合格的自动隔离，趋势在废品堆起来之前就画进图里。

156
00:14:38,503 --> 00:14:46,335
The measuring machine, a five-axis scanner, the roughness tester and every hand gauge report in by themselves.
三坐标、五轴扫描仪、粗糙度仪和每一把手持量具，都自己报数。

157
00:14:46,725 --> 00:14:49,881
A gauge past its calibration date is refused.
过了校准期的量具，读数不收。

158
00:14:50,401 --> 00:14:54,401
The loop closes with a person approving at the key step.
闭环里，关键一步由人确认。

159
00:14:54,791 --> 00:15:00,371
That is the vision. Every step toward it runs on the same record.
这是愿景。通往它的每一步，都跑在同一份记录上。

160
00:15:00,891 --> 00:15:06,771
It's yours to run. The platform sits on a server you control, and your data stays yours.
平台归您自己运行：装在您掌控的服务器上，数据归您。

161
00:15:07,161 --> 00:15:12,981
We teach your people with courses, and offer hosted connections when you need them.
我们用课程教会您的人，需要时提供托管接口服务。

162
00:15:13,371 --> 00:15:18,271
There is no lock-in. Your records sit in a standard open system.
没有绑定。您的记录放在标准的开放系统里。

163
00:15:18,791 --> 00:15:23,251
Don't switch everything at once. Install, import, and put one module live.
不用一次全换。安装、导入，先上线一个模块。

164
00:15:23,641 --> 00:15:30,321
Usually that's incoming inspection or nonconformance. Then turn on the standard, and connect the floor.
通常是来料检验或不合格品。然后启用标准，再接入车间。

165
00:15:30,711 --> 00:15:34,931
Most companies start with one problem they feel every week, and grow from there.
多数公司从每周都头疼的一个问题开始，再一步步扩展。

166
00:15:35,451 --> 00:15:38,365
One record. AI drafts. People decide.
一份记录，AI 起草，人来决定。

167
00:15:38,755 --> 00:15:45,895
We're inviting a small number of pilot companies. If that Tuesday sounded familiar, let's talk.
我们正在邀请少数试点企业。如果那个周二听着耳熟，我们聊聊。
